{"3185470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Forgiveness RPG: The First Chapter","steam_appid":3185470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5315550],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jimmy leaves his home in Joppa Town, he befriends Esther, a witch who is looking for a magical stone to heal her mother. Then, they both find themselves in the middle of a plot to take over the entire world! Can they stop this plot, and will Jimmy tell Esther that Jesus Christ can heal her mother, instead of the magic stone? Find out in the ground-breaking Christian themed RPG, Forgiveness RPG: The First Chapter! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple game play and controls<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A game in the Forgiveness RPG series<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jimmy leaves his home in Joppa Town, he befriends Esther, a witch who is looking for a magical stone to heal her mother. Then, they both find themselves in the middle of a plot to take over the entire world! Can they stop this plot, and will Jimmy tell Esther that Jesus Christ can heal her mother, instead of the magic stone? Find out in the ground-breaking Christian themed RPG, Forgiveness RPG: The First Chapter! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Simple game play and controls<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A game in the Forgiveness RPG series<\/p>","short_description":"A Christian-themed, story driven, japanese-styled role playing video game in the Forgiveness RPG franchise!","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3185470\/81169ecc0831b5f275271ebec90cca8d0064e792\/header.jpg?t=1793654005","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3185470\/c8d4e17dcd44698b6bad32a32ad427d52d47df77